  "protocol": "Seven alternating fresh-Node pairs/sets, 24 pinned Kodak photos, source IO/decode excluded from kernel timer. Kernel: 25 warm-up batches, 500 timed batches =12000 calls including validation, host copies, quantization and owned output. Reference is thumbhash 0.1.1; cachedJS uses the same bounded scratch/cosines/arithmetic as Rust but needs no input FFI copy. Preview: initialization, first 24-photo batch, one warmup batch, 72 timed previews; complete preview JSON digest must match published 3.1.0. No preview-cache reuse. Suites serial; uncontrolled desktop. LQIP is an unchanged-path control, not an expected improvement.",
